OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to spend #1m on airport
OL,4,Aredevelopment plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council is to spend up to #1m on a
OL,7,Fnew plan to redevelop the former
OL,8,FCoventry Airport site, to allow a wider
OL,9,Frange of businesses to move in.
OL,11,FCoventry City Council said, while a
OL,12,Fproposed gigafactory was still part of
OL,13,Fthe scheme, it wanted to open up the
OL,14,Fland to other possible advanced
OL,15,Fmanufacturing occupiers.
OL,17,FThe authority's cabinet approved the
OL,18,Fadditional funding for the new
OL,19,FGreenpower Park planning application at
OL,20,Fa meeting on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
