OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to spend #1m on airport
OL,4,Aredevelopment plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts contribution will comprise half of
OL,7,Fthe money needed for planning,
OL,8,Ftechnical, environmental, legal and
OL,9,Fcommercial work, with the remainder
OL,10,Fcoming from Greenpower Park Ltd,
OL,11,Fformerly Coventry Airport Ltd.
